,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":18877.337118954,"data":"       | Thus pattern may be: For grids where both dimensions are even? 4x4 (both even) gave S=N-1? Wait 4x4 gave S=15 (N-1). 2x2 gave S=4 (N). 2x4 (both even) gave S=8 (N). So not consistent.\n"}
