,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":18877.337402342,"data":"       | Edge (non-corner) cells: there are 4 edges each of length 60, but corners counted twice; total edge cells (including corners) = 4*60 = 240. Subtract corners (4) gives edge non-corner cells = 236 cells degree 3.\n"}
