,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":18877.337970565,"data":"       | analysisPattern: best = n+1? For n=2, best=3 = 2+1. n=3 =\u003e 4 = 3+1. So for line of length n, max min adjacent sum = n+1. Indeed arrangement is alternating low-high: 1,n,2,n-1,3,... yields min sum = n+1.\n"}
