,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":18877.339261667,"data":"       | analysisWe need to find the maximum possible S such that we can fill numbers 1..3600 into a 60x60 grid (i.e., each number used exactly once) with the property that for any two adjacent cells (sharing a side), the sum of the numbers in those two cells is at least S. We need to maximize S.\n"}
