,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":18877.339301988,"data":"       | But maybe we can use averaging arguments: For each edge, sum \u003e= S. Count edges: For a m x n grid (60x60), number of horizontal edges = m*(n-1) = 60*59 = 3540. Number of vertical edges = (m-1)*n = 59*60 = 3540. Total edges = 7080.\n"}
