,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":18877.340529321,"data":"       | Now consider number 2. Its neighbors must be \u003e= 3598. There are numbers 3598, 3597, etc. However some of those high numbers may already be used as neighbors of 1, but we have many high numbers left.\n"}
