,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":18877.340547574,"data":"       | But we must also consider number 1799? For k around 1799, S - k = 1801. So numbers \u003e=1801 must be adjacent to numbers \u003c=1799. That's okay because we have many numbers \u003e=1801 (the upper half). So perhaps we can achieve S=3600.\n"}
