,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":18877.340553481,"data":"       | Better to assign high numbers first? Actually we can design pattern: Use checkerboard: assign all black cells with numbers 1..1800 (small) and white cells with numbers 1801..3600 (large). Then each edge sum is at most 1800+1801=3601. But minimal sum would be maybe 1+1801=1802, which is far less than 3600. So not good.\n"}
