,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":18877.342318404,"data":"       | We have numbers 1800..3600 inclusive (1801 numbers). The top requirements need numbers \u003e= 3598 for two cells, \u003e= 3597 for two cells, \u003e= 3596 for two cells, etc. Since we have numbers 3598, 3599, 3600 (three numbers) to satisfy the two cells needing 3598, we could assign 3598 and 3599 (or 3600). But we also need numbers \u003e= 3597 for other cells, which could be satisfied by remaining high numbers (including 3600 maybe). However we must be careful not to run out.\n"}
