,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":18877.343153205,"data":"       | Let's attempt to construct for N=16 (4x4) using heuristic: assign numbers to cells such that each edge sum \u003e=16. Let's try using integer linear programming with binary variables? Might be large but maybe solvable with pulp? Not allowed.\n"}
