,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":18877.34373549,"data":"       | Total edge sum = Σ value*deg = 2*sum(corner values) + 3*sum(edge values) + 4*sum(interior values). For 4x4, corners 4 deg2, edge (non-corner) cells: (4-2)*4 = 8 cells deg3, interior: (4-2)^2 = 4 cells deg4. So total edge sum = 2*C + 3*E + 4*I, where C+E+I = 136? Wait C+E+I = total sum of values = 136.\n"}
