,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":18877.343770214,"data":"       | analysisAverage edge sum = 456 / E, where E = number of edges = (4-1)*4*2 = 3*4*2 = 24. Actually compute: edges = (4-1)*4 + 4*(4-1) = 3*4 + 4*3 = 12+12=24. So average = 456/24 = 19. So bound S \u003c= 19 (since integer). That's not restrictive.\n"}
