,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":18877.344950699,"data":"       | Thus conjecture: For any m x n grid (with m,n \u003e=2), the maximum minimal adjacent sum equals mn (total number of cells). For 1xn or mx1 (line), maybe different, but not needed.\n"}
