,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":18877.345215512,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":18877.345216558,"data":"       | But we can use heuristic search (local improvement) to try to achieve S=mn for small grid and see if possible. For 4x4, mn=16. Need each adjacent sum \u003e=16. Since max sum is 31, it's plausible. Let's try to construct manually.\n"}
