,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":18877.345219058,"data":"       | Goal: assign numbers 1..16 to 4x4 grid such that each adjacent sum \u003e=16.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":18877.345220239,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":18877.345221268,"data":"       | We can try to place 1 at corner with neighbors \u003e=15. So need numbers 15 and 16 adjacent to 1. That's possible: place 1 at (0,0), 15 at (0,1), 16 at (1,0). Then check other constraints.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":18877.345222648,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":18877.345223665,"data":"       | Let's attempt to construct algorithmically using greedy/backtracking for 4x4.\n"}
