,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":18877.345457597,"data":"       | Given the difficulty, perhaps the maximum S is indeed 3600 and there exists a known construction: Place numbers 1..3600 in a 60x60 grid such that each adjacent sum \u003e= 3600. This is reminiscent of \"anti-magic labeling\" or \"graceful labeling\"? Not exactly.\n"}
