,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":18877.345861878,"data":"       | Let's attempt using python's 'itertools' to generate permutations for 4x4 maybe using pruning: we can assign rows sequentially and prune early.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":18877.345863152,"data":"       | \n"}
