,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":18877.346137663,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":18877.346138715,"data":"       | This is reminiscent of arranging numbers to avoid small sums adjacent: we could place small numbers far apart, large numbers near each other, etc. The maximum S likely is something like 3600+1? Wait sum of two numbers min possible is 1+2=3. But we can arrange to avoid small numbers being adjacent. The worst-case minimal sum will involve the smallest numbers placed such that each is adjacent only to large numbers.\n"}
