,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":18877.34666178,"data":"       |         cur=min(val[a]+val[b] for a,b in edges)\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":18877.346662887,"data":"       |         if cur\u003ebest:\n"}
