,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":18877.346731989,"data":"       | We need to ensure that each high number can serve as neighbor to multiple low numbers, up to its degree. High numbers have degree up to 4, so each high number can be adjacent to up to 4 low numbers. So we need to allocate high numbers to interior cells (degree 4) to serve many low neighbors.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":18877.346733517,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":18877.34673454,"data":"       | Thus maybe we can achieve S=3600.\n"}
