,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":18877.346747121,"data":"       | But we only need each edge sum \u003e=3600, not exactly equal. So we can assign interior cells with high numbers (close to 3600) and border cells with low numbers (close to 1). Since each interior cell has 4 neighbors, each neighbor may be low numbers, but interior high numbers will be large enough to satisfy sum condition.\n"}
