,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":18877.350263122,"data":"       | Consider sum of all numbers = N(N+1)/2. For each edge, sum of its two numbers counted. Edge count: In a grid of size m x n (here 60x60), there are (m-1)n + m(n-1) edges = 2mn - m - n = 2N - m - n = 2*3600 - 60 - 60 = 7200 - 120 = 7080 edges.\n"}
