,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":18877.350488358,"data":"       | But we need guarantee sum \u003e= 3600. Let's attempt to construct algorithmically for 60x60 and test via Python to compute minimal adjacent sum. Use simple pattern: fill numbers row-wise left to right, top to bottom (natural order). That will have small numbers adjacent to slightly larger numbers (difference 1). The minimal sum would be 1+2=3, far from 3600.\n"}
