,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":18877.350519494,"data":"       | Observation: The most restrictive condition is for the smallest b (or w). Suppose we sort B numbers ascending: b1 \u003c= b2 \u003c= ... \u003c= b1800. Similarly W numbers ascending: w1 \u003c= w2 \u003c= ... \u003c= w1800.\n"}
