,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":18877.350522131,"data":"       | If we can ensure that for every b_i, all its neighboring w's are among the larger w's (i.e., w \u003e= S - b_i). The worst-case sum will involve the smallest b with the smallest w adjacent to it.\n"}
