,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":18877.351765651,"data":"       | Let’s sort vertices by label (ascending). For each vertex i with label a_i, we need at least deg(i) numbers among the remaining set (excluding a_i) that are \u003e= S - a_i to be assigned to its neighbors. However those numbers also have other constraints.\n"}
