,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":18877.352043819,"data":"       | But maybe we can deduce formula: Suppose we partition numbers into two sets L and H of equal size 1800 each. Let L contain the smallest 1800 numbers (1..1800). Let H contain the largest 1800 numbers (1801..3600). Then any edge sum is at least 1+1801 = 1802, far from optimum.\n"}
