,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":18877.352052364,"data":"       | Thus we can select any 1800 numbers as high set; we can choose them to be the largest 1800 numbers (i.e., 1801..3600). That gives min(H) = 1801. Min(L) = 1. So min sum = 1802.\n"}
