,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":18877.352117881,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":18877.352118941,"data":"       | We can attempt to find maximal t via algorithmic search using greedy assignment: assign low numbers to white cells (maybe 1..1800) in some order (maybe increasing), compute required minima for adjacent black cells, then assign numbers to black cells from the pool of remaining numbers (1801..3600) ensuring each black cell's label \u003e= required minimum and distinct.\n"}
