,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":18877.352811027,"data":"       | Specifically, after sorting mins descending, the smallest mins will be 1 (maybe multiple). The rank of these minima will be near the end (since sorted descending, smallest mins are last). For those ranks k near 1800, additive term (k-1) is large (~1799). So the expression may still be high enough.\n"}
