,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":18877.353983094,"data":"       | The worst case will be the smallest low number (maybe 1) and the smallest high number adjacent to it. So we need to guarantee that for the smallest low number, all its neighboring whites are among the highest numbers.\n"}
