,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.70023386,"data":"       | analysisLet's verify: first placement is horizontal at row0 col0-col1 (cells 0 and 1). left neighbor of cell0 is None (col0). right neighbor of cell1 is cell2 (col2). So neighbor list [2] correct.\n"}
