,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.700242314,"data":"       | We'll maintain:\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.700243964,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.700245583,"data":"       | - occupied set O (set of cells already covered)\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.700246764,"data":"       | - required set R (set of cells that must be covered)\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.70024791,"data":"       | - placed list D (list of placements)\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.700249051,"data":"       | - best solution (global minimal m)\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.700250171,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.700251287,"data":"       | We start with O empty, R empty, D empty.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.700252463,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.700253521,"data":"       | At each step, we can either stop if R empty (i.e., all requirements satisfied) and we have a valid configuration. But we also need to ensure that any placed domino's neighbor cells are satisfied (R empty ensures that). So we can record solution.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.700256964,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.70025816,"data":"       | But we also need to consider that we could stop early with no dominoes placed (R empty). That would be trivial solution with m=0, but does it satisfy condition? If no dominoes placed, condition vacuously holds? The problem likely expects at least one domino placed; but minimal m may be \u003e0 because we need to place dominoes such that each cannot slide. If we place zero dominoes, there are no dominoes to slide, but the problem likely expects at least one domino placed. However they ask \"Place m 1x2 dominos on a 7x7 chessboard such that no domino can slide horizontally or vertically when other dominos remains fixed. Find minimal possible value of m.\" Usually they expect at least one domino; but trivial solution m=0 would satisfy condition vacuously, but not interesting. So we assume m\u003e0.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.700260797,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.700261851,"data":"       | Thus we need to find minimal positive m.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.700262987,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.700264031,"data":"       | Thus we need to search for configurations with at least one domino.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.700265224,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.700266968,"data":"       | We can start recursion by selecting a required cell to cover (if any). If R empty, we could optionally stop (found solution). But we also need to consider adding more dominoes even if R empty? That would increase m, not minimal.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.700268457,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.700269521,"data":"       | Thus algorithm: start with O empty, R empty. Since R empty, we could stop with m=0, but we ignore that. So we need to force at least one domino. So we can start by trying each possible placement as first domino, and then recursively satisfy requirements.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.700271027,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.70027212,"data":"       | Thus we can iterate over placements as first domino, compute O,R after placing it, then recursively fill.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.700273344,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.700274388,"data":"       | We also need to ensure we don't exceed board cells.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.700275593,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.700276954,"data":"       | Let's implement recursion with pruning.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.700278054,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.70027915,"data":"       | We'll also compute lower bound: each domino can cover at most 2 required cells (since each domino covers 2 cells). So needed additional dominoes \u003e= ceil(|R|/2). Also we need to consider that some required cells may be impossible to cover due to parity or adjacency constraints. But we can ignore for now.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.700280758,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.700281791,"data":"       | We'll also maintain a visited state maybe to prune duplicates: O and R sets define state; but there may be many.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.700283033,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.700284081,"data":"       | Given board size small, recursion may be feasible.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.700285234,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.700286261,"data":"       | Let's implement search for minimal m.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.700287374,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.70029006,"data":"       | assistantanalysis to=python codefrom functools import lru_cache\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.700291265,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.700292388,"data":"       | n=7\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.700293453,"data":"       | placements = placements  # from earlier\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.70029456,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.700295571,"data":"       | # Precompute neighbor cells for each placement\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.700296724,"data":"       | placement_neighbors = [neighbors_of_placement(p) for p in placements]\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.700297894,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.700298925,"data":"       | # For each cell, list placements covering it\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.70030003,"data":"       | placements_covering_cell = [[] for _ in range(n*n)]\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.700301261,"data":"       | for idx,p in enumerate(placements):\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.700302365,"data":"       |     a,b,_ = p\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.700303434,"data":"       |     placements_covering_cell[a].append(idx)\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.700304563,"data":"       |     placements_covering_cell[b].append(idx)\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.700305788,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.700306804,"data":"       | best_solution = None\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.700307897,"data":"       | best_m = 1000\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.700308943,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.70031008,"data":"       | def search(O_set, R_set, placed_indices):\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.700311175,"data":"       |     global best_m, best_solution\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.700312251,"data":"       |     # prune if already worse than best\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.700313971,"data":"       |     current_m = len(placed_indices)\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.700315218,"data":"       |     # lower bound on additional dominoes needed\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.700316393,"data":"       |     lower = (len(R_set) + 1) // 2  # ceil\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.700318424,"data":"       |     if current_m + lower \u003e= best_m:\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.700319568,"data":"       |         return\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.70032082,"data":"       |     # if no required cells left, we have a valid solution\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.700321993,"data":"       |     if not R_set:\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.700323077,"data":"       |         # valid solution found\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.700324177,"data":"       |         if current_m \u003e 0 and current_m \u003c best_m:\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.700325585,"data":"       |             best_m = current_m\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.700326688,"data":"       |             best_solution = placed_indices.copy()\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.700327814,"data":"       |             print(\"New best\", best_m)\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.70032902,"data":"       |         return\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.700330234,"data":"       |     # choose a required cell to cover next\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.70033134,"data":"       |     # heuristic: pick cell with few covering placements\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.700332505,"data":"       |     # compute candidate placements that can cover a required cell and not overlap O\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.700335214,"data":"       |     # choose cell with minimal options\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.700336528,"data":"       |     # compute for each required cell the list of placements that cover it and are compatible\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.700337737,"data":"       |     min_options = None\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.700338814,"data":"       |     chosen_cell = None\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.700339884,"data":"       |     candidate_placements = None\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.700341025,"data":"       |     for cell in R_set:\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.700342087,"data":"       |         options = []\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.700343147,"data":"       |         for pi in placements_covering_cell[cell]:\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.700344274,"data":"       |             a,b,_ = placements[pi]\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.700345365,"data":"       |             # check if both cells are free (not already occupied)\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.700346531,"data":"       |             if a in O_set or b in O_set:\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.70034765,"data":"       |                 continue\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.70034875,"data":"       |             # also need to ensure that placing this domino does not create new required cells that are already occupied? That's okay.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.700350231,"data":"       |             options.append(pi)\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.700351468,"data":"       |         if min_options is None or len(options) \u003c min_options:\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.70035289,"data":"       |             min_options = len(options)\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.700354017,"data":"       |             chosen_cell = cell\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.700355104,"data":"       |             candidate_placements = options\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.700356391,"data":"       |         if min_options == 0:\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.700357708,"data":"       |             break\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.700358787,"data":"       |     if min_options == 0:\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.70035989,"data":"       |         # dead end\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.700360975,"data":"       |         return\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.700362038,"data":"       |     # iterate over candidate placements\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.700363133,"data":"       |     for pi in candidate_placements:\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.700364305,"data":"       |         a,b,_ = placements[pi]\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.700368917,"data":"       |         # new occupied set\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.70037014,"data":"       |         new_O = O_set | {a,b}\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.700371245,"data":"       |         # new required set: start from current R, remove cells now covered, add new neighbor cells of this domino\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.700372593,"data":"       |         new_R = set(R_set)\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.700373888,"data":"       |         # remove any required cells that are now covered\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.700375045,"data":"       |         new_R.discard(a)\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.700376118,"data":"       |         new_R.discard(b)\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.700377191,"data":"       |         # add neighbor cells of this domino (if within board and not already occupied)\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.700380224,"data":"       |         for nb in placement_neighbors[pi]:\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.700381374,"data":"       |             if nb not in new_O:\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.700382468,"data":"       |                 new_R.add(nb)\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.700383601,"data":"       |         # also need to consider that this domino may have neighbor cells that are already occupied; that's fine.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.700385001,"data":"       |         # proceed recursively\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.700386091,"data":"       |         search(new_O, new_R, placed_indices + [pi])\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.700387241,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.700388278,"data":"       | # start search by trying each placement as first domino\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.700389436,"data":"       | for i,p in enumerate(placements):\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.700390524,"data":"       |     a,b,_ = p\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.70039159,"data":"       |     O = {a,b}\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.700392661,"data":"       |     R = set()\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.700393738,"data":"       |     for nb in placement_neighbors[i]:\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.700394826,"data":"       |         if nb not in O:\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.700395916,"data":"       |             R.add(nb)\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.700396978,"data":"       |     search(O,R,[i])\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.700398041,"data":"       | print(\"Best m:\", best_m)\n"}
