,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.701270581,"data":"       | Now each domino has 2 sides (left/right or up/down). So total side requirements (i.e., sides that need neighbor) = 2m - (number of board-edge sides). Since each board-edge side reduces requirement count by 1 (no neighbor needed). So total neighbor requirements = 2m - B, where B ≤ m.\n"}
