,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.701655322,"data":"       | analysisThe function returns best as the minimal number found within limit? Actually for limit=1, it returns best=2 (since it found solution with 2? Wait we didn't find solution with 1, but best=2 maybe from lower bound? Not important. The key is ok=False for limits up to 7, meaning no solution with ≤limit dominoes. So minimal m is at least 8. Good.\n"}
