,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.701884269,"data":"       | We could implement a simple branch-and-bound search enumerating subsets of placements, using constraints to prune early. Since we need minimal m, we can start from low m and test feasibility.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.701895249,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.701896324,"data":"       | Number of placements 84, but we need to select at most maybe 12? Unknown.\n"}
