,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.701903787,"data":"       | Better approach: Use exact cover algorithm (Algorithm X) to find minimal cover satisfying constraints. Could treat each domino as covering its two cells and also providing \"blocking\" for neighbor cells.\n"}
