,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.70234971,"data":"       | Now we need to ensure each required cell is occupied by some domino (i.e., belongs to some placement in the set). So we need to check that for each required cell tuple (size 1 or 2), each cell in the tuple is covered.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.702351043,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.702352039,"data":"       | Thus we can define for each placement i a list of required cell sets (each set of size 1 or 2). The condition: for each required set, all cells in the set must be covered by some domino in S.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.702353459,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.702354542,"data":"       | Now we can implement search.\n"}
