,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.703874429,"data":"       | analysisSo unsatisfied is not empty for any single placement. Then why find_solution returned True for m=1? Let's debug find_solution for m=1: It may return solution early due to visited set being empty and unsatisfied not checked? Let's add prints inside find_solution to see.\n"}
