,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.70511331,"data":"       | - For each cell c, sum_{p containing c} x_p ≤ 1 (non-overlap). Actually exactly 1 if cell occupied else 0. But we don't require covering all cells; we just need some cells occupied.\n"}
