,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.706363595,"data":"       | Maximum number of edge cells: total edge cells = 24 (including corners). Edge non-corner cells = 20. Each edge domino uses 2 cells, both of which must be edge cells (if we want to maximize edge dominos). However edge dominos could also use one edge cell and one interior cell (still edge domino with 3 interior sides). So the count of edge dominos is limited by number of edge cells available.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.706365176,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.706366118,"data":"       | But we can approximate lower bound on R.\n"}
