,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.706382942,"data":"       | We need lower bound on m given that each domino must have at least 2 interior sides, and each interior side must be adjacent to an occupied cell (which is part of some domino). However each occupied cell can be adjacent to at most 4 interior sides (as neighbor). So we have R ≤ 4 * (2m) = 8m (same). Not helpful.\n"}
