,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.70746425,"data":"       | This is reminiscent of \"blocking dominoes\" or \"locked domino tilings\". Might be related to \"domino sliding puzzle\" where each domino cannot move because blocked by other dominoes or board edges. Equivalent to each domino's two translation neighbor cells are occupied (by other dominoes or board edge). Since board edges also block sliding beyond board.\n"}
