,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.707480385,"data":"       | Observation: For a horizontal domino at column 1 (c=1) (leftmost), sliding left is impossible because out of board. So only need to block sliding right: need cell (r,c+2) occupied. Similarly at rightmost column (c=6) (since 1x2 occupies columns 6 and 7), sliding right blocked by edge, need to block sliding left: cell (r,c-1) occupied.\n"}
