,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.707520673,"data":"       | We also need to ensure that each cell can be covered by at most one domino (since dominoes cannot overlap). So we need packing constraints: For each cell, sum_{d covering cell} x_d \u003c= 1.\n"}
