,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.707550716,"data":"       | We can treat as hitting set: each domino requires covering of its side cells. So we need to ensure that for each domino, each side cell is either board edge or occupied by some domino.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.707552052,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.707553087,"data":"       | Thus we can think of constructing a set of dominoes such that the union of occupied cells includes all side cells of each domino.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.707554326,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.707555356,"data":"       | Thus we need a set of dominoes that is \"self-covering\" with respect to side adjacency.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.707556608,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.707557641,"data":"       | We can attempt to solve using integer programming via `python-mip`? Not.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.707558805,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.707559808,"data":"       | Maybe we can reason analytically.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.707560902,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.707561904,"data":"       | Observation: For a domino not on board edge, it needs both side cells occupied. So each interior domino requires two neighboring cells to be occupied. Those neighboring cells could be part of other dominoes, which may be interior or edge.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.707565173,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.707566247,"data":"       | Edge dominoes require only one neighbor cell (the side not at edge). So edges are efficient.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.707567445,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.707568459,"data":"       | Thus to minimize number, we likely use many dominoes placed along edges, because they require fewer other dominoes to block them.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.707569705,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.70757071,"data":"       | But each edge domino also occupies cells that could serve as side cells for other dominoes.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.707571908,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.70757292,"data":"       | Goal: find configuration with minimal dominoes.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.707574028,"data":"       | \n"}
