,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.708957648,"data":"       | If a direction has no cells (i.e., moving off board would go out of board), then it's automatically blocked (no need to occupy). Actually if moving off board is impossible because cells are out of board, then direction is blocked automatically. So we can treat block set as empty, meaning condition satisfied automatically.\n"}
