,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.709348344,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.709349597,"data":"       | Thus a domino can satisfy at most 10 clause contributions (if both cells each appear in 5 distinct clauses). But overlapping may reduce.\n"}
