,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.709351879,"data":"       | Our bound using 9 is okay.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.709352976,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.709353992,"data":"       | Now implement DFS with iterative deepening.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.709355089,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.709356134,"data":"       | We'll also sort unsatisfied clauses by size (1 then 2) to prioritize.\n"}
