,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.711223999,"data":"       | Simplify: For each direction set S, we need at least one domino covering any cell in S. So we can treat each cell as \"occupied\" if some domino covers it. So we need for each direction set S, at least one covering domino.\n"}
