,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.711228967,"data":"       | Thus we can think of O = set of occupied cells (by dominos). Condition: For each placed domino p, for each direction d, O ∩ S(p,d) ≠ ∅ (or S empty). So O must intersect each of those sets.\n"}
