,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.711233757,"data":"       | Thus we can search using backtracking similar to before but with condition that for each placed domino, each direction set must intersect O (including possibly later placements). So we need to ensure that after final O, each direction set has at least one cell in O.\n"}
