,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.711236307,"data":"       | Thus we can implement search where we maintain O and list of placed dominos S. At each step, we can add a domino p (non-overlapping). After adding, we need to ensure that for each direction set of p, there exists at least one cell in O (including the cells of p itself? Wait direction sets exclude p's own cells, but they could intersect O via other dominos. So after adding p, we may not yet have cells covering those sets; they may be added later. So we cannot enforce immediately; we need to ensure that it's possible to satisfy later.\n"}
