,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.711244299,"data":"       | Thus we can maintain a set of unsatisfied requirement sets (each is a set of cells). When we add a domino, we update O and remove any requirement sets that intersect O. Also new domino adds new requirement sets (its direction sets) that are not yet satisfied.\n"}
