,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.713090954,"data":"       | Let's attempt to implement a backtracking that tries to place dominoes while ensuring constraints for placed dominoes are satisfied locally, and also that future placements can satisfy constraints for already placed dominoes (i.e., external neighbor cells must be eventually occupied). This is tricky.\n"}
