,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.713095627,"data":"       | Maybe we can brute force using `python` and `itertools.combinations` for small m (like up to 8) but that's C(84,8) ~ 2e10 too large.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.713098781,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.71309985,"data":"       | Thus we need smarter.\n"}
