,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.713223434,"data":"       | Define all possible domino placements (edges) as tuples (cell1, cell2, orientation). For each domino, compute its external neighbor cells: left neighbor of cell1 (if orientation horizontal) and right neighbor of cell2 (if orientation horizontal). For vertical orientation, external neighbors are above cell1 and below cell2.\n"}
