,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.713252643,"data":"       | Implementation: Use recursion to select dominoes one by one, maintaining occupied set and forced set. At each step, we can prune if forced set size \u003e 2*remaining_dominoes (since each remaining domino can add at most 2 new occupied cells). Actually forced cells not yet occupied need to be covered by remaining dominoes; each remaining domino can cover at most 2 new cells, but could also cover forced cells that are already forced but not yet occupied. So we need at least ceil(|forced_not_occupied|/2) dominoes left.\n"}
