,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.714568865,"data":"       | We can treat board cells as 0..48. Represent placement as list of edges (pairs of cell indices). Use recursion to place dominos, maintain occupied cells set, and ensure blocking constraints for already placed dominos maybe not fully check until all placed? Actually blocking constraints involve occupied cells of other dominos, which may be placed later. So we need to ensure final configuration satisfies constraints. Hard to prune early.\n"}
