,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.716174069,"data":"       | But we observed that up to m=20, no solution. So minimal m \u003e20? But maximum possible dominos is 24 (since 49 squares, one empty). So answer likely 21,22,23,24. We already know 24 works (full tiling). Need to see if 21,22,23 possible.\n"}
