,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.716813689,"data":"     [Reasoning] (3979 chars):\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.716814765,"data":"       | analysisThe search naive may be too slow for m up to 12. Need better pruning.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.716817218,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.716818475,"data":"       | We can also incorporate that each domino's ends must be blocked; we can enforce constraints incrementally: when we place a domino, we may need to ensure that its ends can be blocked later. For each end that is not edge and not currently occupied, we need to guarantee that there is at least one remaining placement that can occupy that cell. This can be used for pruning.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.716820121,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.716821153,"data":"       | Also we can order placements to prioritize edges maybe.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.716822268,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.716823305,"data":"       | But perhaps minimal m is small like 6 or 7, and search for those may be feasible with pruning.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.716824509,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.716825542,"data":"       | Let's add pruning: for each placed domino, for each end cell that is not edge, if currently not occupied, we need to ensure that there exists at least one unused placement that can occupy that cell and does not conflict with current occupancy. If none, prune.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.716827031,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.716828068,"data":"       | Similarly for any unoccupied cell that is required as blocker for some placed domino, we must eventually occupy it.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.716829302,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.716830442,"data":"       | Let's implement improved recursion.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.716831525,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.716832539,"data":"       | assistantanalysis to=python codedef search_min_m(limit=12):\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.716833675,"data":"       |     N = len(placements)\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.716834728,"data":"       |     occupied = [[False]*C for _ in range(R)]\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.716835853,"data":"       |     chosen = []\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.716836912,"data":"       |     # Precompute for each cell the list of placement indices that cover it\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.716838075,"data":"       |     cell_to_pl = cell_to_placements\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.716839192,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.716840202,"data":"       |     # Helper to check if a cell is currently occupied\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.716841318,"data":"       |     def is_occupied(cell):\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.716842385,"data":"       |         return occupied[cell[0]][cell[1]]\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.716843479,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.716844548,"data":"       |     # For a given set of chosen placements, we can compute required cells that must be occupied:\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.716845736,"data":"       |     # For each chosen placement idx, for each end cell e not None, we need e occupied.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.716846916,"data":"       |     # We'll enforce that eventually.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.716847991,"data":"       |     # We'll maintain a set of required cells that must be occupied (including maybe already occupied).\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.716849205,"data":"       |     # But we can compute on the fly.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.716850279,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.716851291,"data":"       |     # recursion\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.716853928,"data":"       |     def rec(start, placed, target):\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.716855058,"data":"       |         # prune by free cells bound\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.716856148,"data":"       |         free_cells = sum(not occupied[i][j] for i in range(R) for j in range(C))\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.716857319,"data":"       |         if placed + free_cells//2 \u003c target:\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.716858475,"data":"       |             return False\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.716859561,"data":"       |         # Check feasibility of required cells for already placed dominos\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.716860736,"data":"       |         for idx in chosen:\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.716861821,"data":"       |             left_end, right_end = ends_list[idx]\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.716863085,"data":"       |             for end in (left_end, right_end):\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.716864215,"data":"       |                 if end is None:\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.716865318,"data":"       |                     continue\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.716866385,"data":"       |                 if not is_occupied(end):\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.716867498,"data":"       |                     # need at least one possible placement covering end that does not conflict with current occupancy\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.716868725,"data":"       |                     possible = False\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.716869802,"data":"       |                     for p_idx in cell_to_pl.get(end, []):\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.716870928,"data":"       |                         # check if placement p_idx can be placed (no overlap)\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.716872095,"data":"       |                         (a,b) = placements[p_idx]\n"}
