,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.71750697,"data":"       | analysisSo configuration: Horizontal dominos at top row cells (0,0)-(0,1) and bottom row (2,1)-(2,2). Vertical dominos at rightmost column (0,2)-(1,2) and leftmost column (1,0)-(2,0). Visualizing 3x3 board:\n"}
