,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.717518125,"data":"       | Check each domino:\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.717519208,"data":"       | Top H: left neighbor out of board (col -1) edge, right neighbor (0,2) occupied by V right. Good.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.717520413,"data":"       | Right V: top neighbor out of board (row -1) edge, bottom neighbor (2,2) occupied by bottom H. Good.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.717521643,"data":"       | Left V: top neighbor (0,0) occupied by top H, bottom neighbor out of board? Wait bottom neighbor of left V is (3,0) out of board (since row 3 \u003e2). Actually left V covers (1,0)-(2,0). Its bottom neighbor (3,0) out of board, top neighbor (0,0) occupied. Good.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.717523155,"data":"       | Bottom H: left neighbor (2,0) occupied by left V, right neighbor out of board (col 3) edge. Good.\n"}
