,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.718505312,"data":"       | We can treat each domino as a \"segment\" of length 2 along a line. For each domino, we need occupied cells at both neighboring positions (or board edge). Equivalent to each domino must be part of a \"blocked line\" where there is no empty cell adjacent to its ends.\n"}
