,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.718509525,"data":"       | Thus we can think of each row (or column) as a 1D line of length 7. We place horizontal dominos covering pairs of adjacent cells. For each such domino, the cells immediately left and right must be either occupied (by any domino) or outside board.\n"}
