,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.71863424,"data":"       | Thus we can generate all subsets of dominos of size m, check constraints after full selection. For m small, number of subsets may be huge: C(84,m). For m=5, C(84,5) ~ 2.5e7, too many.\n"}
