,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.718647315,"data":"       | Simplify: Use backtracking that places dominos one by one, ensuring no overlap. At each step, we can also check for any domino that becomes \"unblockable\" (i.e., its neighbor cells are both empty and cannot be occupied later due to constraints). But that's complex.\n"}
