,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.71867785,"data":"       | Maybe we can think of constructing minimal configuration manually.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.718679001,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.718680086,"data":"       | Consider constructing a \"cross\" shape: place a vertical domino in column 4 rows 2-3 (center), and another vertical domino rows 4-5 same column, etc. But we need each domino blocked left/right by occupied cells. The vertical dominos need occupied cells above and below them. So we need vertical chain of length at least 3 cells in column to block middle domino. Similarly horizontal chain for horizontal dominos.\n"}
