,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.720000653,"data":"       | We'll implement recursive search: choose a domino placement, add it, maintain occupied cells set, and maintain list of unsatisfied requirements for placed dominos. At each step, we can also add dominos to satisfy outstanding requirements.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.72000211,"data":"       | \n"}
