,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.720355537,"data":"       | For example, consider tiling the board completely with dominos (24 dominos) - then obviously each domino cannot slide because board is fully covered (except maybe some sliding possible if there are gaps?). Actually if board fully tiled, any domino cannot slide because any move would require empty cells which are not present. So m=24 works. But we need minimal.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.720357844,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.720359386,"data":"       | We can try to reduce number of dominos while still blocking.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.720361211,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.720362856,"data":"       | Potential minimal may be around 12 (half board). Let's test by constructing a pattern: Place dominos covering all cells of a \"cross\" shape? Not.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.720365066,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.72036669,"data":"       | Let's attempt to use computational search with heuristic: use simulated annealing or random local search to find configuration with small m that satisfies condition. Since the search space is large but we can use heuristic to find low m.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.720368818,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.72037028,"data":"       | We can treat each cell as either occupied (by domino) or empty. Then we need to assign domino pairings to occupied cells. Could use local moves to add/remove dominos.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.720372353,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.720373893,"data":"       | Simplify: Use integer programming with MILP using `pulp` not available. Could implement using `ortools` not available.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.720376877,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.72038031,"data":"       | But we can implement using `python` with `mip`? Not.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.720381973,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.72038345,"data":"       | Maybe we can use `z3` but not available.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.720385106,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.720386686,"data":"       | Alternative: Use custom branch-and-bound: choose placements gradually, but also maintain a lower bound on remaining needed placements to block all existing dominos.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.72038874,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.720390331,"data":"       | Observation: For each placed domino, each unblocked direction requires at least one cell to be occupied. So we can compute minimal additional dominos needed to satisfy all those requirements: each new domino adds 2 cells, which can satisfy up to some number of requirements. Hard.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.720392566,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.72039427,"data":"       | Maybe we can attempt to search for minimal m using BFS from empty board, adding dominos one by one, checking if final condition satisfied, and stop when found. BFS will explore many states but we can prune by symmetry maybe.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.720396406,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.720397911,"data":"       | But board is 7x7; number of possible placements 84; BFS depth up to maybe 12; branching factor large.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.720400053,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.720401287,"data":"       | But we can use heuristic to prioritize placements that block many others.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.720402457,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.720403611,"data":"       | Let's attempt random greedy algorithm: start with empty board, iteratively add a domino that blocks the maximum number of currently unblockable directions, until all placed dominos are blocked. Then record number of dominos used. Repeat many random runs to find minimal.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.720405119,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.720406146,"data":"       | Let's implement simulation to see typical m.assistantanalysis to=python codeimport random, math, itertools, collections, sys, time\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.720407443,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.72040862,"data":"       | R, C = 7,7\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.720409673,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.720410701,"data":"       | # Precompute placement info\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.72041179,"data":"       | placements = []\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.72041296,"data":"       | placement_masks = []\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.720414019,"data":"       | placement_cells = []\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.720415088,"data":"       | for r in range(R):\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.720416188,"data":"       |     for c in range(C-1):\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.72041739,"data":"       |         placements.append(((r,c),(r,c+1)))  # horizontal\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.720418534,"data":"       | for r in range(R-1):\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.720419593,"data":"       |     for c in range(C):\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.720420669,"data":"       |         placements.append(((r,c),(r+1,c)))  # vertical\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.720421988,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.720424683,"data":"       | def mask_of(p):\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.720425769,"data":"       |     (r1,c1),(r2,c2)=p\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.720426858,"data":"       |     return (1 \u003c\u003c (r1*C + c1)) | (1 \u003c\u003c (r2*C + c2))\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.720428126,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.720429338,"data":"       | placement_masks = [mask_of(p) for p in placements]\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.720430493,"data":"       | placement_cells = placements\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.720431578,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.720432598,"data":"       | # Directions: up, down, left, right\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.720433697,"data":"       | dirs = [(-1,0),(1,0),(0,-1),(0,1)]\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.720434788,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.720435814,"data":"       | def required_cells_for_move(p, dir_idx):\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.720436953,"data":"       |     # returns list of cell coordinates that must be empty for domino p to slide in direction dir_idx\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.720438163,"data":"       |     # we will use to check blocking: if any of these cells is occupied or out of board, then slide is blocked.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.720439393,"data":"       |     # Actually slide is possible if all required cells are empty and inside board.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.720440638,"data":"       |     (r1,c1),(r2,c2) = p\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.720441703,"data":"       |     dr, dc = dirs[dir_idx]\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.720442821,"data":"       |     # Determine orientation\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.720443941,"data":"       |     if r1==r2: # horizontal\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.720445106,"data":"       |         # sliding left/right (horizontal move) requires single cell beyond left/right\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.72044645,"data":"       |         if dir_idx==2: # left\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.720447534,"data":"       |             # leftmost cell is min(c1,c2)\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.720448636,"data":"       |             leftc = min(c1,c2)\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.720449726,"data":"       |             target = (r1, leftc-1)\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.720450906,"data":"       |             # need this cell empty and inside board\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.720452056,"data":"       |             return [target]\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.720453138,"data":"       |         if dir_idx==3: # right\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.72045424,"data":"       |             rightc = max(c1,c2)\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.720455456,"data":"       |             target = (r1, rightc+1)\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.720456566,"data":"       |             return [target]\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.720457653,"data":"       |         # sliding up/down (vertical move) requires two cells above/below both cells\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.720458836,"data":"       |         if dir_idx==0: # up\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.720460001,"data":"       |             return [(r1-1,c1),(r2-1,c2)]\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.720461133,"data":"       |         if dir_idx==1: # down\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.72046222,"data":"       |             return [(r1+1,c1),(r2+1,c2)]\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.720463358,"data":"       |     else: # vertical\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.720472989,"data":"       |         if dir_idx==0: # up\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.720475963,"data":"       |             top = min(r1,r2)\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.720477731,"data":"       |             target = (top-1, c1)\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.720479398,"data":"       |             return [target]\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.720480924,"data":"       |         if dir_idx==1: # down\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.720482443,"data":"       |             bottom = max(r1,r2)\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.720484178,"data":"       |             target = (bottom+1, c1)\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.720485876,"data":"       |             return [target]\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.720487618,"data":"       |         if dir_idx==2: # left\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.720489521,"data":"       |             return [(r1,c1-1),(r2,c2-1)]\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.720491353,"data":"       |         if dir_idx==3: # right\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.720493079,"data":"       |             return [(r1,c1+1),(r2,c2+1)]\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.720494846,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.720496754,"data":"       | def in_board(cell):\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.720498534,"data":"       |     r,c = cell\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.720500114,"data":"       |     return 0 \u003c= r \u003c R and 0 \u003c= c \u003c C\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.720503297,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.72050454,"data":"       | def slide_possible(p, occupied_set, dir_idx):\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.720505776,"data":"       |     # returns True if slide possible given occupied_set (set of occupied cells)\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.720506956,"data":"       |     req = required_cells_for_move(p, dir_idx)\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.720508063,"data":"       |     # if any required cell out of board -\u003e slide blocked\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.720509224,"data":"       |     for cell in req:\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.720510371,"data":"       |         if not in_board(cell):\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.72051148,"data":"       |             return False\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.720512688,"data":"       |     # all required cells inside board; slide possible if all are empty (not occupied)\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.720513871,"data":"       |     for cell in req:\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.72051493,"data":"       |         if cell in occupied_set:\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.720516009,"data":"       |             return False\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.720517156,"data":"       |     return True\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.720518216,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.720519226,"data":"       | def is_immobile(config):\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.72052029,"data":"       |     # config: list of placement indices selected\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.720521546,"data":"       |     occupied_set = set()\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.720522636,"data":"       |     for idx in config:\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.720523698,"data":"       |         occupied_set.update(placement_cells[idx])\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.720524827,"data":"       |     # check each domino\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.720526026,"data":"       |     for idx in config:\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.720528866,"data":"       |         p = placement_cells[idx]\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.720529983,"data":"       |         for d in range(4):\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.720531058,"data":"       |             if slide_possible(p, occupied_set, d):\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.720532196,"data":"       |                 return False\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.720533276,"data":"       |     return True\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.720534346,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.72053536,"data":"       | # test random greedy\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.720536413,"data":"       | def greedy_random():\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.720537467,"data":"       |     occupied = set()\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.720538536,"data":"       |     selected = []\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.720539694,"data":"       |     # while not all selected dominos are immobile? Actually we need to ensure after each addition we maintain ability to eventually block.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.720540997,"data":"       |     # We'll just keep adding random non-overlapping placements until the current set is immobile.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.72054219,"data":"       |     available = list(range(len(placements)))\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.720543299,"data":"       |     random.shuffle(available)\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.720544387,"data":"       |     for idx in available:\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.720545466,"data":"       |         # try to add if non-overlap\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.720546556,"data":"       |         cells = set(placement_cells[idx])\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.720547669,"data":"       |         if occupied \u0026 cells:\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.72054879,"data":"       |             continue\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.720549876,"data":"       |         # add\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.72055093,"data":"       |         selected.append(idx)\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.720551996,"data":"       |         occupied.update(cells)\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.720553281,"data":"       |         # check if current selected set is already immobile (maybe earlier)\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.720554461,"data":"       |         if is_immobile(selected):\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.720555573,"data":"       |             return selected\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.720556646,"data":"       |     return None\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.72055771,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.720558759,"data":"       | best = None\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.7205598,"data":"       | for _ in range(2000):\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.720560886,"data":"       |     sel = greedy_random()\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.72056197,"data":"       |     if sel is not None:\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.720563046,"data":"       |         m = len(sel)\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.720564111,"data":"       |         if best is None or m \u003c best:\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.720565276,"data":"       |             best = m\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.720566327,"data":"       |             print(\"new best\", best)\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.720567536,"data":"       | best\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.720568579,"data":"       | \n"}
