,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.723281183,"data":"       | Thus we need to choose a set of domino placements such that for each domino D, for each direction dir, the \"adjacent pair\" of cells in that direction (i.e., the two cells that would be newly occupied) intersect the set of cells occupied by other dominos, or are off-board.\n"}
