,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.723452714,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.723455066,"data":"       | Number of non-overlapping subsets of size k is the number of ways to place k dominos without overlap (i.e., k-domino packings). This number grows quickly but for small k maybe manageable.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.723456457,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.723457491,"data":"       | We can approximate: Number of ways to place 1 domino: 84. 2 dominos non-overlapping: approximate 84*~80/2 = 3360? Actually compute exactly maybe ~3000. 3 dominos maybe tens of thousands. 4 dominos maybe hundreds of thousands. 5 dominos maybe millions. So up to maybe k=5 we can brute force.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.723459039,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.723460057,"data":"       | If minimal m is maybe 5 or 6, we can find.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.723461204,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.723462226,"data":"       | Let's implement backtracking generating placements in order, using bitmask to ensure no overlap, and stop when we find a valid configuration of size k.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.723463531,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.7234715,"data":"       | We'll also incorporate early pruning: for each placed domino, we need to ensure that its required directions can potentially be satisfied by future placements. That is, for each direction pair that is interior, at least one of the two cells must be either already occupied by another placed domino (excluding its own) or still free (could be occupied later). If both cells are already occupied by its own domino? Not possible. So we just need to ensure that not both cells are already blocked by being outside board? Wait we need at least one occupied eventually. If both cells are currently empty and also cannot be occupied later because they are on board but we might still occupy them later. So no early prune.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.723476228,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.7234778,"data":"       | But we can prune if a direction pair consists of cells that are currently occupied by the same domino? Not possible.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.723479967,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.723481555,"data":"       | Thus early pruning limited.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.723484313,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.723485418,"data":"       | But we can still generate all packings for small k.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.723486534,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.723487561,"data":"       | Let's code.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.723488615,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.723489639,"data":"       | assistantanalysis to=python codefrom itertools import combinations\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.723490799,"data":"       | \n"}
