,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.723936533,"data":"       | We'll also attempt early pruning: For any placed domino, if there is a direction with required set on-board and none of the cells in that set are currently occupied and also cannot be occupied later because they are already taken by other placed dominos? Actually they could be occupied later by future placements. So can't prune.\n"}
