,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.723939012,"data":"       | But we can prune based on remaining cells: if there are directions that require cells that are currently free but there are not enough remaining placements to cover them? That's complex.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.723940305,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.723941261,"data":"       | We'll just brute force.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.723942262,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.723943217,"data":"       | We need to be careful about runtime. Let's try for k from 1 upwards.\n"}
