,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.7251477,"data":"       | Also we can incorporate ordering of placements to avoid permutations: we can enforce that we only consider placements with index \u003e= last added index to avoid duplicate orderings. We'll keep a parameter `min_idx` that ensures we only add placements with index \u003e= min_idx, to avoid permutations.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.725149301,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.725150337,"data":"       | Let's implement again with improved heuristics.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.725151484,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.7251525,"data":"       | assistantanalysis to=python codeimport sys, time\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.725153617,"data":"       | R, C = 7, 7\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.725154669,"data":"       | def idx(r,c):\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.725155727,"data":"       |     return r*C + c\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.725156807,"data":"       | \n"}
