,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.728446181,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.728447498,"data":"       | Goal: minimize number of dominos needed to achieve this blocking property. So we need smallest m such that we can arrange m dominos with the property that each domino is \"immobile\".\n"}
