,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.729898898,"data":"       | But maybe minimal m is small enough that we can search with BFS using heuristic: we can treat board as graph where each cell can be occupied; we need to choose dominos such that each domino's neighbor cells are occupied (by other dominos). This resembles a matching problem with extra constraints.\n"}
