,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.730098724,"data":"       | We'll precompute for each domino: its cells (two) and neighbor cells (list of up to 2 inside board). We'll also precompute a bitmask representation for occupied cells using 49 bits integer to speed overlap checks.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.730100131,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.730101156,"data":"       | We can map each cell index 0..48 (row*7+col). Represent domino occupancy as bitmask with two bits set.\n"}
