,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.730104539,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.730105564,"data":"       | Then for a subset, we can OR the bitmasks; if any overlap (i.e., bitwise AND of any two \u003e0) we can detect using cumulative OR and checking count bits vs sum bits.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.730106897,"data":"       | \n"}
