,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.730483013,"data":"       | analysisThat's 406 million combos, too many.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.730484118,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.73048512,"data":"       | Thus minimal m \u003e5. Could be 6? But enumeration huge.\n"}
