,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.730621763,"data":"       | We need endpoint on edge. Let's try to design path of 6 cells that ends on edge.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.730622917,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.730623946,"data":"       | We can think of path of 6 cells: start at (0,0), then step right to (0,1), down to (1,1), right to (1,2), down to (2,2), right to (2,3), down to (3,3). That's 7 cells (including start) maybe.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.730625321,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.730626659,"data":"       | Let's compute: start (0,0) cell1, cell2 (0,1), cell3 (1,1), cell4 (1,2), cell5 (2,2), cell6 (2,3) -\u003e that's 6 cells. End at (2,3) not edge. Need end on edge: maybe we can go to (0,6) after 6 steps? Not possible due to distance.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.730628088,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.730629139,"data":"       | Better to start at an edge cell and after 5 moves (6 cells) end at another edge cell. Let's search algorithmically for path of length L cells (L even) with endpoints on edge, simple, and L minimal.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.730630508,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.730631526,"data":"       | We can brute-force search for L=4 (2 dominos) and L=6 (3 dominos) etc using DFS.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.730632693,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.730633743,"data":"       | Let's implement DFS that builds path step by step, ensuring no repeats, and stop when length even and endpoints both on edge and condition satisfied (i.e., each domino's neighbor condition). Actually if path satisfies endpoints on edge, then domino condition automatically holds. Let's verify: For interior dominos, neighbors are previous and next cells, both occupied. For endpoint dominos, one neighbor is edge (blocked). So path condition is sufficient.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.730635517,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.730636531,"data":"       | Thus we just need to find minimal number of dominos (i.e., minimal even L/2) such that a simple path of length L cells exists with endpoints on edge and L even.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.730637848,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.730638873,"data":"       | But also need that each domino's orientation matches the direction of the two cells; that is automatically true because each domino comprises two consecutive cells along path.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.730641747,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.730642782,"data":"       | Thus we can search for minimal L.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.730643898,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.730644938,"data":"       | Let's brute-force DFS limited depth maybe up to 8 (4 dominos). Let's try.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.730646099,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.730647128,"data":"       | assistantanalysis to=python codefrom collections import deque\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.730648269,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.730649293,"data":"       | R=7\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.73065033,"data":"       | C=7\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.730651391,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.73065242,"data":"       | def is_edge(cell):\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.730653509,"data":"       |     r,c=cell\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.73065456,"data":"       |     return r==0 or r==R-1 or c==0 or c==C-1\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.730655659,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.730656684,"data":"       | # generate neighbor moves (4-direction)\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.730657886,"data":"       | moves=[(-1,0),(1,0),(0,-1),(0,1)]\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.730658968,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.730659973,"data":"       | def find_min_path(max_dominos=6):\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.730661133,"data":"       |     # BFS over paths (list of cells)\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.730662234,"data":"       |     # start from each edge cell\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.730663321,"data":"       |     visited_states=set()\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.730664417,"data":"       |     queue=deque()\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.730665478,"data":"       |     for r in range(R):\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.730666529,"data":"       |         for c in range(C):\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.730667603,"data":"       |             if is_edge((r,c)):\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.730668689,"data":"       |                 path=[(r,c)]\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.730669949,"data":"       |                 queue.append(path)\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.730671069,"data":"       |     while queue:\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.730672136,"data":"       |         path=queue.popleft()\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.73067321,"data":"       |         L=len(path)\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.730674273,"data":"       |         # check if length even and endpoints both edge\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.730675389,"data":"       |         if L%2==0 and is_edge(path[0]) and is_edge(path[-1]):\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.730676531,"data":"       |             # number of dominos = L//2\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.730677625,"data":"       |             return L//2, path\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.730678695,"data":"       |         if L\u003e=2*max_dominos:\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.730679836,"data":"       |             continue\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.730680893,"data":"       |         # extend path by moving to adjacent cell not visited\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.730684273,"data":"       |         r,c=path[-1]\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.730685376,"data":"       |         for dr,dc in moves:\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.730686457,"data":"       |             nr,nc=r+dr,c+dc\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.730687549,"data":"       |             if 0\u003c=nr\u003cR and 0\u003c=nc\u003cC:\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.730688838,"data":"       |                 if (nr,nc) not in path:\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.730689935,"data":"       |                     new_path=path+[(nr,nc)]\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.730691064,"data":"       |                     # we could prune using visited states (set of tuple of path?) but for small depth it's fine\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.730692285,"data":"       |                     queue.append(new_path)\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.730693379,"data":"       |     return None\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.730694427,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.73069543,"data":"       | print(find_min_path(6))\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.730696506,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.730697518,"data":"     [Code]:\n"}
