,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.732025898,"data":"       | Place domino D1 horizontal at top edge covering (0,0)-(0,1). Left edge off board; right neighbor (0,2) occupied by D2 vertical covering (0,2)-(1,2). D2's up neighbor off board; down neighbor (2,2) maybe occupied by D3 horizontal covering (2,1)-(2,2). D3 left neighbor (2,0) maybe occupied by D4 vertical covering (1,0)-(2,0). Let's check each domino.\n"}
