,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.732034546,"data":"       | - D2: V at (0,2)-(1,2). Needs up neighbor off board (good). Down neighbor (2,2) occupied by D3? D3 horizontal covering (2,1)-(2,2) includes cell (2,2). Yes, D3 occupies (2,2). So D2 satisfied.\n"}
