,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":19207.732037051,"data":"       | - D3: H at (2,1)-(2,2). Needs left neighbor (2,0) occupied by D4? D4 vertical covering (1,0)-(2,0) includes (2,0). Good. Right neighbor (2,3) empty currently -\u003e not satisfied. Could adjust D3 orientation or add another domino D5 to occupy (2,3). So need more.\n"}
